                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "My impression is, its a good concept and execution.\r\nIt is an adventure game with puzzle that you have to solve. The puzzles are pretty logical. There were instances where i had go back and forth but nothing too hard.\r\nEssentially you are together with an AI that will help you escaping a planet that is doomed. Doing so, will confront you with what went wrong and see the story unfold. There are some decisions to make and they may play a role in the outcome.\r\nOverall its actually a real fun game. The graphics looking super (if you like pixels) and it reminded me off Lucas Arts games. You won't need a mouse as you use the keyboard as the input. So, its pretty simple to play.\r\nAnyway, i had a lot of fun with this game and recommend it to anyone that likes a fair good story in the vein of good old adventure games. You won't be disappointed.",
